hastikarṇa
(1) = hastikarṇapalāśa:
a) Leea macrophylla Roxb. (CD, p. 89-91; Bt.; R.S. Singh and A.
N. Singh in IJHS 16, 2, 1981, p. 219-222);
b) Butea superba Roxb. (HK);
c) B. monosperma (Lamk.) Taub. = B. frondosa Roxb. (HK);
(2) = mūṣikaparṇī (HK);
(3) = raktairaṇḍa (Indu on A.s.Ci. 19, 10).
